sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Administrator
  participant UI as Transactions page
  participant MW as Middleware
  participant SA as Server action
  participant FN as admin_reverse_transaction
  participant DB as Tables
  A->>UI: Reverse + reason
  UI->>UI: Key created when<br/>dialog opens
  UI->>MW: POST (session cookie)
  MW->>MW: Refresh session,<br/>require admin role
  MW->>SA: forward
  SA->>FN: rpc with admin JWT
  FN->>FN: is_admin(), reason,<br/>key replay check
  FN->>DB: Lock original, then<br/>accounts in order
  FN->>DB: No balance may<br/>go negative
  FN->>DB: Insert reversal and<br/>mirrored entries
  FN->>DB: Mark original reversed
  FN->>DB: Audit + notify owners
  FN-->>SA: result
  SA-->>UI: refresh pages
  UI-->>A: Shows Reversed
